      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2KI",
          "chapter": 10,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "But they were exceedingly afraid, and said, “Behold, the two kings didn’t stand before him! How then shall we stand?”",
      "ko": "저희가 심히 두려워하여 가로되 두 왕이 저를 당치 못하였거든 우리가 어찌 당하리요 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "1300633845eeb3b1592f181f4774a00e18644c83cd9e0e3ee7c95ca89a9384ab",
      "translation_text_hash": "b26f23c0c757cffc388c9036cc49755542c8c2833ab0827ce8151e5233ae5c75",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저희가 심히 두려워하여 가로되 두 왕이 저를 당치 못하였거든 우리가 어찌 당하리요 하고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b26f23c0c757cffc388c9036cc49755542c8c2833ab0827ce8151e5233ae5c75"
      ]
