        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2KI",
          "chapter": 10,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "He arose and departed, and went to Samaria. As he was at the shearing house of the shepherds on the way,",
      "ko": "예후가 일어나서 사마리아로 가더니 노중에 목자가 양털 깎는 집에 이르러",
      "source_text_hash": "faea9ff66b91411671c9e451ec569a85c5e792e4db239381435d945acf7bab25",
      "translation_text_hash": "54f8e49c3209ede26646e980a4b1300fafcf81f8e36ca32ed284762b2d88be05",
