          "book": "2KI",
          "chapter": 10,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "Jehu met with the brothers of Ahaziah king of Judah, and said, “Who are you?” They answered, “We are the brothers of Ahaziah. We are going down to greet the children of the king and the children of the queen.”",
      "ko": "유다 왕 아하시야의 형제들을 만나 묻되 너희는 누구냐 대답하되 우리는 아하시야의 형제라 이제 왕자들과 태후의 아들들에게 문안하러 내려가노라",
      "source_text_hash": "081d4cd77f6c629dd000a874dc04333de0253ce03e2fca0c94c1e8080d5f8040",
      "translation_text_hash": "2de76694d5a983195e40c125b7a39d41dd4bc51c7cdbc4e980918f25ae496b85",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
