      "en": "He said, “Take them alive!” They took them alive, and killed them at the pit of the shearing house, even forty-two men. He didn’t leave any of them.",
      "ko": "가로되 사로잡으라 하매 곧 사로잡아 목자가 양털 깎는 집 웅덩이 곁에서 죽이니 사십 이인이 하나도 남지 아니하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a1853960fe749e497ebcb9f83ca0c78259e7f4c8dc9103e862da5572d2141e99",
      "translation_text_hash": "fc9c3b23a2b1eb3b1b2642a797b2f3884bf157375c626e626073f9480a8cfda2",
