      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2KI",
          "chapter": 10,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "Jehu said, “Sanctify a solemn assembly for Baal!” So they proclaimed it.",
      "ko": "예후가 바알을 위하는 대회를 거룩히 열라 하매 드디어 공포하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "0e3bcda81eebe5d4648158e29a192949f6f2cab185066fbc76ed3a1da4dc06f6",
      "translation_text_hash": "04b997fb0be941bc92f99651967530bbf570609255853a37125bdd7275fa35b7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
