      "en": "They broke down the pillar of Baal, and broke down the house of Baal, and made it a latrine, to this day.",
      "ko": "바알의 목상을 헐며 바알의 당을 훼파하여 변소를 만들었더니 오늘날까지 이르니라",
      "source_text_hash": "39c5e575231823298c53d86cf66d44bf1e272d8b2280bfba33562809c6bbe558",
      "translation_text_hash": "c9eac45ecb1f7d7cf2d5515769aa4faff9fdc9f61ce44717d82b809791dbe73e",
