      "en": "Now the rest of the acts of Jehu, and all that he did, and all his might, aren’t they written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Israel?",
      "ko": "예후의 남은 사적과 무릇 행한 일과 모든 권세는 이스라엘 왕 역대지략에 기록되지 아니하였느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "cf00d5f673b59c0297d9916e79ec9b8580fa845fcae3dddf10780426da8baaf8",
      "translation_text_hash": "6369a210929d7d84e9c0417dbb3a6c34a99b67d97ebd8d11bb111e8f7d1522eb",
